{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "This trip was sold on an UPFRONT_QUOTE: the quoted fare of SGD 27.40 on the fare breakdown is exactly the SGD 27.40 total charged, so the rider paid the price she accepted at booking and there is no overcharge for a refund to reach.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00701"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-11"],
      "relies_on": "fare_breakdown.derived.money.charged_over_quote",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Under POL-RD-11 the distance and time charges on an upfront-quoted trip were fixed at booking, so the rider was never out of pocket on those lines however far the vehicle drove; POL-RD-02 does not run and no distance-or-time refund is available, whether the trace excess is taken at 6.15 km or at any other figure.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00701", "EV-GPS-00701"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-11", "POL-RD-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.excess_km",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Every pass-through and statutory line on the ledger is zero — no ERP gantries charged (tolls_erp 0.00), airport surcharge 0.00, waiting-time fee 0.00 — so the amount by which charged_total exceeds quoted_fare_sgd plus the properly chargeable lines under POL-RD-11(a) is SGD 0.00, and the fare computation itself records a POL-RD-11 remedy of 0.00.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00701"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-11", "POL-RD-09"],
      "relies_on": "fare_breakdown.derived.money.pol_rd_11_remedy",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no off-route or phantom charge for POL-RD-09(4) to correct: the fare breakdown carries no ERP gantry entries at all (erp_gantries empty) and the airport surcharge line is 0.00, consistent with a trip that ends at an airport rather than originating at one.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00701"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09"],
      "relies_on": "fare_breakdown.derived.money.erp_lines",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The trace shows an excess of 6.15 km, 29.71% of the 20.7 km optimal — above the POL-RD-01 establishment gate but below the material gate (neither greater than 50% nor greater than 8.0 km) — so no POL-RD-06 repeat-pattern check is engaged; and in any event driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 0 against 250 completed_trips_90d, far below both the 3-flag and the 5% pattern thresholds, so no pattern exists and no conduct uplift follows.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00701", "EV-TRIP-00701", "EV-DPROF-00701"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-01", "POL-RD-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.excess_pct",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The SGD 40 cash the rider says she handed over appears nowhere on the fare breakdown and is not a platform charge; the SGD 27.40 contested is the platform fare alone, and POL-RD-11 confines the rider's remedies to the lines of the fare breakdown, so an off-ledger cash allegation the driver denies cannot ground a platform refund.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00701"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-11"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver's trace is complete and unimpaired for policy purposes: 247 fixes at a 10 s cadence, coverage_pct 100.0, max_gap_sec 0.0 and no gaps at all, so POL-RD-07(a) to (c) is not triggered and the measured excess stands on a clean, unimpaired trace.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00701"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-07"],
      "relies_on": "max_gap_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "None of POL-RD-10's escalation triggers fires: the trip identifiers match across trip_record, gps_trace and fare_breakdown; the trace is gap-free and unimpaired; the timestamps run forward consistently (requested 08:12, started 08:18:40, ended 08:59:40); and the computed refund is 0.00, far below the SGD 150 ceiling — so a monetary ruling is available and the disputed amount need not be held for a human reviewer.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-00701", "EV-GPS-00701", "EV-FARE-00701"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-10"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "NO_ACTION under POL-GEN-03 is party-relative and leaves fare_breakdown.payment_status CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd 0.00 exactly as they stand; on this rider-filed dispute that preserves the upfront fare the driver earned under the booking quote, rather than reversing it.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00701"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-GEN-03"],
      "relies_on": "fare_breakdown.payment_status",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
}

