as a RYDE_X booking, not a RYDE_POOL match (solo_optimal_distance_km null), so POL-RD-12 does not apply. Nothing in the policy reaches the SGD 40 the rider says she handed over in cash; it appears nowhere on the platform ledger and is not a platform charge. No traffic advisory is on file (EV-ADVIS-00701-01, MISSING, weight 0.0, issue MISSING_ARTIFACT), so no external traffic cause can be weighed - that gap changes no money. There is no billing-integrity defect (no phantom gantry, no wrongly applied surcharge), so no POL-RD-09(4) referral, and no POL-RD-10 escalation trigger fires. Outcome: NO_ACTION - the charge already made stands, with no refund, no driver compensation and no referrals.",
